ADDITIONAL NOTICE FOR SMART CONTRACTS

The smart contracts in this project are not audited. Please conduct thorough
security audits before deploying to production networks.

DISCLAIMER FOR AFRICAN RWA SYSTEMS

This software is designed to facilitate tokenization of real-world assets in
Africa. Users are responsible for:

1. Complying with all applicable local, national, and international laws
2. Obtaining proper regulatory approval for RWA tokenization
3. Respecting indigenous land systems and customary ownership structures
4. Ensuring proper title verification and legal documentation
5. Managing community participation and benefit-sharing arrangements
6. Following all government regulatory frameworks

The ÒsánVault project and contributors disclaim responsibility for:
- Regulatory violations by users
- Improper asset tokenization
- Violation of indigenous or community rights
- Unauthorized claim of land or resource ownership
- Non-compliance with local regulations

